{
  "dashboard_name": "Residential Homebuilder Dashboard Template",
  "source": "analytics",
  "report": "# Residential Homebuilder Operations Report\n\n## Overview\nThis dashboard gives Sunrise Homes LLC a complete view of their residential construction pipeline — from active builds and permitting to closings, warranty claims, and the forward sales pipeline across subdivisions.\n\n## Key Metrics\n- Homes Under Construction: 34\n- Homes Closed YTD: 18\n- Avg Construction Days: 112\n- Open Warranty Claims: 9\n- Sales Pipeline (Units): 41\n\n## Insights\n- YTD closings pace of 18 homes in Q1 is strong; the sales pipeline of 41 units supports continued throughput through Q3.\n- Avg construction cycle of 112 days is within industry norms; material shortage risks (roofing shingles) could push this above 120 days if unresolved.\n- 9 open warranty claims should be triaged — HVAC and structural items carry highest customer satisfaction risk.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "Homes Under Construction",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Homes Under Construction",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"status": ["In Progress"]}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "34"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "number",
      "name": "YTD Closings",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Homes Closed YTD",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"status": ["Completed"], "period": "ytd"}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "18"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "name": "Construction Pipeline by Phase",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Homes by Construction Phase",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {},
            "group_by": "phase"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "grouped bar"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "name": "Warranty Claims Trend",
      "data_config": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Warranty Claims",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"type": "Warranty Claim"}
          }
        ],
        "group_by": ["custom_dates"],
        "date_from": "2025-01-01",
        "date_to": "2025-12-31",
        "date_interval": "monthly",
        "aggregation": "count"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bar",
      "name": "Monthly Closings",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Closings per Month",
            "data_source": "projects",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "count",
            "filters": {"status": ["Completed"]},
            "group_by": "close_month"
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "bar chart"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "name": "Active Warranty & Work Items",
      "calculation": {
        "datasets": [
          {
            "name": "Open Work Items",
            "data_source": "ticketing",
            "module": "Construction",
            "operation": "list",
            "filters": {"status": ["Open", "In Progress"]}
          }
        ],
        "expected_value": "item list"
      },
      "column_count": 4,
      "column_width": 200
    }
  ]
}
